        "original_id": "2dac1a89-f73c-5a50-8c48-7d97825348c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Casey Kelly, Adrián González\n- Organizations: Boston Red Sox, San Diego Padres, Los Angeles Dodgers, Major League Baseball\n- Roles: minor league prospect, professional baseball first baseman, All-Star player\n- Events: 2010 offseason trade\n\nFacts:\n- After the 2010 season, Casey Kelly was the top minor league prospect in the Boston Red Sox organization.\n- After the 2010 season, the San Diego Padres acquired Casey Kelly and three other prospects in a trade for All-Star player Adrián González.\n- Adrián González Savín was born on May 8, 1982.\n- Adrián González Savín is also known by the nicknames A-Gon and Titán.\n- Adrián González Savín is an American-born Mexican professional baseball first baseman for the Los Angeles Dodgers of Major League Baseball.",
